      "id": "opening-geometry",
      "title": "How wide is the range, and where does NQ open?",
      "description": "Use complete overnight windows for width and available opening geometry for the location distribution. Points are NQ price points.",
      "finding": "Median width was 67.2 NQ points in 2015–2019 and 160.2 points from 2020 onward. Of the two-window sessions, 1 opened outside and 1 opened exactly at a boundary.",
